/E (RESULT DISPUTES: Students must contact the Director of Studies and Quality Assurance Office in writing within  14 calendar days of the official results release date. Disputes raised after this deadline will not be considered.  Address all dispute correspondence to: Director of Studies & Quality Assurance, Jolis ICT Academy. )
