441 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 156 0 R
/T (\(a\) A student who misses a coursework component without prior written approval from the Academic Director will receive zero marks for that component. This zero will be factored into the collective coursework score and may adversely affect the student's final module grade.  \(b\) Absence from the final module examination without prior written approval will result in a score of zero for  the examination component. A student in this situation must apply in writing to the Academic Director for a  deferred examination, which may be granted at the Academy's discretion and may attract an additional  administrative fee.  \(c\) A student whose combined module score \(coursework + examination\) falls below 80% will be required to  repeat the module in full in accordance with Clause 2.3 above. )
/E (\(a\) A student who misses a coursework component without prior written approval from the Academic Director will receive zero marks for that component. This zero will be factored into the collective coursework score and may adversely affect the student's final module grade.  \(b\) Absence from the final module examination without prior written approval will result in a score of zero for  the examination component. A student in this situation must apply in writing to the Academic Director for a  deferred examination, which may be granted at the Academy's discretion and may attract an additional  administrative fee.  \(c\) A student whose combined module score \(coursework + examination\) falls below 80% will be required to  repeat the module in full in accordance with Clause 2.3 above. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [18]
>>
