/T (\(a\) Harassment, bullying, intimidation, or threats directed at students, staff, or any third party are strictly  prohibited.  \(b\) Physical violence or assault will result in immediate suspension and referral to law enforcement authorities.  \(c\) Discriminatory conduct based on race, ethnicity, religion, gender, nationality, disability, or sexual orientation  is prohibited.  \(d\) Possession or consumption of alcohol, illegal drugs, or controlled substances on Academy premises is strictly  prohibited. \(e\) The Academy operates a zero-tolerance policy regarding sexual harassment, sexual assault, and gender-based  violence.  \(f\) Disorderly or offensive conduct in class, on Academy premises, or in any Academy-related online forum is  prohibited.  \(g\) Disciplinary proceedings may include a formal warning, suspension, expulsion, or referral to relevant  authorities. A student subject to disciplinary proceedings shall be notified in writing and shall have the right to  respond before a final decision is made. )
/E (\(a\) Harassment, bullying, intimidation, or threats directed at students, staff, or any third party are strictly  prohibited.  \(b\) Physical violence or assault will result in immediate suspension and referral to law enforcement authorities.  \(c\) Discriminatory conduct based on race, ethnicity, religion, gender, nationality, disability, or sexual orientation  is prohibited.  \(d\) Possession or consumption of alcohol, illegal drugs, or controlled substances on Academy premises is strictly  prohibited. \(e\) The Academy operates a zero-tolerance policy regarding sexual harassment, sexual assault, and gender-based  violence.  \(f\) Disorderly or offensive conduct in class, on Academy premises, or in any Academy-related online forum is  prohibited.  \(g\) Disciplinary proceedings may include a formal warning, suspension, expulsion, or referral to relevant  authorities. A student subject to disciplinary proceedings shall be notified in writing and shall have the right to  respond before a final decision is made. )
