/Title (This Student Registration and Institutional Agreement Form \("the Form" or "the Agreement"\) is issued by Jolis ICT Academy \("the Academy" or "the Institution"\) to all prospective and returning students \("the Applicant" or "the Student"\). Upon submission and acceptance by the Academy, this Form constitutes a formal and binding contract between the Student and the Academy.  The purposes for which this Form is issued include, but are not limited to: student identification and verification,  academic administration, financial processing, regulatory compliance, emergency contact management, disciplinary  record-keeping, data protection compliance, institutional policy enforcement, and legal proceedings where applicable.  All fields marked with an asterisk \(*\) are MANDATORY. Incomplete forms will not be processed. All information  provided is subject to verification. The Academy reserves the right to reject any application at its sole discretion  without being required to disclose reasons.)
