<<
/Title (Allfees,levies, and charges prescribed by the Academy are the sole responsibility of the Student. No Student shall be considered fully enrolled unless all applicable fees have been settled or a formal written payment arrangement has been approved by the Finance Department.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1285 0 R
/Next 1295 0 R
>>
endobj
1295 0 obj
<<
/Title (\(a\) All fees must be paid in accordance with the payment schedule issued at the time of registration.  \(b\) Failure to pay fees by the prescribed deadline will result in restricted access to Academy facilities, learning  materials, and digital platforms. \(c\) Unpaid fees may result in withholding of examination results, academic transcripts, and certificates of  completion.  \(d\) Instalment payment plans are available upon written request and are subject to approval at the sole discretion  of the Finance Department.  \(e\) All fees paid are non-refundable unless the Academy expressly cancels a programme. Withdrawal by a student  after commencement does not entitle the student to any refund.  \(f\) The Academy reserves the right to recover any unpaid fees through legal means, including referral to a debt  collection agency or civil proceedings.  \(g\) Students are strictly prohibited from making payments to any individual staff member. All payments must be  directed to official Academy bank accounts or approved mobile payment channels.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1285 0 R
/Prev 1294 0 R
>>
endobj
