/Title (\(a\) Astudent who scores below 80% in any daily evaluation, module assessment, or final examination will be considered to have failed that component.  \(b\) Failure to achieve the 80% pass mark in the final module examination, after all coursework has been factored  in, will result in the student being required to repeat the entire module. Module repeat conditions, including any  applicable fees, will be communicated to the student in writing. \(c\) A student required to repeat a module must do so before being permitted to proceed to the next module in  the programme.)
