<<
/Title (Assessment Component Coursework \(Collective\)  50% All daily evaluations, assignments, practicals, and in-module tasks completed throughout the module collectively contribute 50% of the final module grade.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1317 0 R
/Prev 1325 0 R
/Next 1332 0 R
>>
endobj
1332 0 obj
<<
/Title (Weighting Final Module Examination  50% A formal end-of-module examination administered by the Academy. This examination assesses the student's comprehensive understanding of the entire module and contributes the remaining 50% of the final module grade.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1317 0 R
/Prev 1331 0 R
/Next 1326 0 R
>>
endobj
1333 0 obj
<<
/Title (\(a\) A student who misses a coursework component without prior written approval from the Academic Director will receive zero marks for that component. This zero will be factored into the collective coursework score and may adversely affect the student's final module grade.  \(b\) Absence from the final module examination without prior written approval will result in a score of zero for  the examination component. A student in this situation must apply in writing to the Academic Director for a  deferred examination, which may be granted at the Academy's discretion and may attract an additional  administrative fee.  \(c\) A student whose combined module score \(coursework + examination\) falls below 80% will be required to  repeat the module in full in accordance with Clause 2.3 above.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1326 0 R
>>
endobj
